WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.360
Hello there!

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.750
Welcome to our show.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.760
Of course, I'm Conan.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:08.930
We're coming to you once
again from the Largo Theater

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:12.080
here in Hollywood in Los Angeles.

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.830
And I'm very excited,

00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:16.570
because for the first time
since the COVID outbreak

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:18.870
I'm joined in person

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.350
by my pal Andy Richter!

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.920
Andy's with us. Hey Andy!

00:00:22.920 --> 00:00:24.660
[Andy] I'm over here!

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:27.340
Where?
No, back here! Hi!

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.260
Okay if I take my mask off, right?

00:00:29.260 --> 00:00:32.800
Yes, I think we're not
only six feet apart,

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.030
I think we're about 36 feet apart.

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:37.460
Right, as you requested.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:39.760
I requested that long before COVID.

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.560
Yes, and people can't tell,

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.667
but there's a wall of
plexiglass in front of me

00:00:44.667 --> 00:00:48.760
that we've really spent, like three hours,

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:50.400
lighting it so you can't see it.

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.450
Yeah, we broke into seven
different Applebee's

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.990
and stole the plexiglass from
their salad bar to construct-

00:00:56.990 --> 00:01:00.500
Your dream of a perpetual sneeze guard

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:02.370
around your life is coming true.

00:01:02.370 --> 00:01:03.203
How are you?

00:01:03.203 --> 00:01:05.571
This is the first time you
and I have been together.

00:01:05.571 --> 00:01:07.470
Yeah!
You're looking well.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:10.499
Thank you. Yeah, I'm
pretty good, you know?

00:01:10.499 --> 00:01:12.650
I've been packin' on the pounds,

00:01:12.650 --> 00:01:15.300
just, you know, for the
nuclear winter that's coming.

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:18.810
You know, other than that...

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.210
Hair's gettin' long.

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:21.363
Yep. Yep.

00:01:22.370 --> 00:01:24.080
Wow, look at you.
Lettin' my freak flag fly.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:25.200
You too, I see.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.563
Yeah, my hair's gotten long.
You're gettin' shaggy.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:30.350
If I let it go it collapses.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.770
If I comb it up into a pompadour
wave it becomes a tsunami.

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:36.763
Yes.
It becomes a crazy tsunami.

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:39.690
Some people have said recently online

00:01:39.690 --> 00:01:42.440
that they're frightened,
(Andy laughs)

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:44.160
so I don't know what to do.

00:01:44.160 --> 00:01:46.600
But I like it. I kinda
like just letting it go.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.433
[Andy] Yeah.

00:01:47.433 --> 00:01:51.630
This is a time to explore
different hairstyles,

00:01:51.630 --> 00:01:55.730
possibly different sexual, uh...

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:58.263
What?

00:01:58.263 --> 00:02:00.300
I don't know. You just stopped.

00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:03.490
You said sexual and then you
just came to a screeching halt.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:05.896
I know. I think I got
too real for a second.

00:02:05.896 --> 00:02:07.565
(Andy chuckles)

00:02:07.565 --> 00:02:10.260
And this is the point where we cut out

00:02:10.260 --> 00:02:12.489
five minutes of you just crying.

00:02:12.489 --> 00:02:14.592
(Conan bawls)
Quietly sitting there crying.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:17.513
Ah, I've never been fulfilled!

00:02:18.570 --> 00:02:20.613
I finally know who I am!

00:02:20.613 --> 00:02:23.693
(laughing) The laughter doesn't help!

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.020
Now, here's my question.

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:28.410
You don't have to be
that far away from me.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.373
Why are you that far away?

00:02:31.370 --> 00:02:34.040
Just to be safe, you know?

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.870
I mean-
No! That's not being safe.

00:02:36.870 --> 00:02:40.090
I know that you've been talking
to people mostly on Zoom,

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:43.090
but you get a lotta riffraff on this show.

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:44.680
So who knows? Like, what do you got?

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.060
Lithgow?
Yeah.

00:02:46.060 --> 00:02:49.260
That guy's probably
just soaked with COVID.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.280
(Conan laughs)

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:53.330
Yeah, Lithgow's kind
of a sketchy character.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:54.670
Yeah. Yeah, he sure is.

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.740
This is what I like. You
36 feet away from me.

00:02:57.740 --> 00:02:58.693
That's right!

00:02:59.610 --> 00:03:01.203
In Row L.

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:03.800
L for likin' it.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:04.910
Or loser.

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:07.500
Okay, that's our show.
We'll see you tomorrow.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.230
I'm now gonna walk towards Andy.

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.630
Andy, you have to keep the
same distance away from me!

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:14.383
[Andy] Oh boy. All right.

00:03:15.372 --> 00:03:16.320
[Conan] Here I come!

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:19.601
[Andy] You're a lot faster
than me though. Go slow.

00:03:19.601 --> 00:03:22.184
(cheery music)

00:03:31.212 --> 00:03:33.433
(Andy laughs)

00:03:33.433 --> 00:03:34.850
It's my show now!

